{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "029ass_306_2_3_029_06_09_a",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:54ccd92c7fed67587277c5b4d7450dd81d042e841de6e4bc834eb18bd529d1b5",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:029ass_306_2_3_029_06_09_a:2_3_029_06_09_a:cmd-000006:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:423e2a267398088db3908824d621f4a18aa9043e5ebc41b192968189480fca57",
      "text": "哈哈哈哈！吾主啊，\n圣夜的仪式已将光之子民诱向了甜美的黑暗！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:029ass_306_2_3_029_06_09_a:2_3_029_06_09_a:cmd-000008:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0db2d922c313ac3519b5630b31a1ded091c7f14538adb6e369bc58598a3deadd",
      "text": "好，辛苦您了",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:029ass_306_2_3_029_06_09_a:2_3_029_06_09_a:cmd-000011:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f98408c6c658f75ae3b83d5517622212177530917a407b5c6d4ad262c89e618a",
      "text": "哼，在黑暗巢穴向邪恶仆从\n赏赐的供品，亦博得了欢呼之声。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:029ass_306_2_3_029_06_09_a:2_3_029_06_09_a:cmd-000013:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ba1cfa0f779acfb9e0be09ebe58322abb95f76cb2c12c352acf851aa2e86fc23",
      "text": "特别是涟……那家伙转眼间便吃个精光，\n那副模样，当真是痛快至极。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:029ass_306_2_3_029_06_09_a:2_3_029_06_09_a:cmd-000015:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a4f174601e71d332424b386213987cf47bd6b0595620f060d871d3c062504331",
      "text": "对我之供品的赞美之辞，亦即\n向我献上的祭品……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:029ass_306_2_3_029_06_09_a:2_3_029_06_09_a:cmd-000017:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:924e83c384637b3c1fb3b46950cf3055971cc8c172a9060f09a02c178c1b1658",
      "text": "阿斯兰先生做的料理\n真的非常好吃",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:029ass_306_2_3_029_06_09_a:2_3_029_06_09_a:cmd-000018:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bc8b2ab54856c573c94d32f47509756c4d664babfaf273a790c0ee2afdee1413",
      "text": "一直以来都很感谢\n阿斯兰先生",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:029ass_306_2_3_029_06_09_a:2_3_029_06_09_a:cmd-000021:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b18842ad7a24a91db6ee6ab1a7898fb805c6f7e0cd63807c6e41a1fa2fb98a49",
      "text": "嗯。我所精炼的供品，正以至高无上为目标。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:029ass_306_2_3_029_06_09_a:2_3_029_06_09_a:cmd-000026:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:27f63a264ac8040d9368d136da11387d35ebfe934d21ef755929b4393b4b52a6",
      "text": "吾主的心意，我已确凿领受。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:029ass_306_2_3_029_06_09_a:2_3_029_06_09_a:cmd-000030:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:75cae102a7deb30200f14224ee613124012492ae52ec655d1eef1489d065a5e2",
      "text": "吾主啊，下次我将备好迎接新一年的\n飨宴供品。好好期待吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
